          <p>
            Three things stand out. No shake on the list delivers both a full meal's calories and a high protein dose; Ka'Chava comes closest on protein and fiber per calorie, which is why it tops the list despite sitting at the top on price. Raw Organic Meal is the most efficient per calorie but needs food added. And the three bottled shakes, Soylent, Ensure Plus and Orgain, trade protein for convenience: they are easy to carry and need no mixing, but they give the least protein per calorie on the list.
