            And if what you really wanted was more protein, skip the meal shakes entirely. A plain protein powder gives you the same protein for a fraction of the calories and cost, and blended with oats and fruit it becomes a homemade meal whenever you need one. Check the label on the flavor you buy, replace one meal rather than all of them, and talk to your doctor if you have a medical condition or take medication.
          </p>
